# GNU Stow's built-in ignore list excludes files named `.gitignore` (and `.git`,
# CVS/SVN/hg cruft, top-level README/LICENSE, editor backups). That would skip
# our global ~/.gitignore. Providing this file REPLACES the built-in list for
# the `git` package, so both .gitconfig and .gitignore get stowed.
# Patterns are Perl regexes matched against the path and basename.
\.DS_Store
